 so hurt  and my husband too but it was really  looking at my kids they look  so hurt that it's not my  decision so i'm going to do whatever i  can to stay  to stay alive it's  i realized that's being alive is uh  the focus is about service  it's not it's about what you can do for  others  and that's the christian story  that's an unselfish concern for the  welfare of people who are in you  yes you know that's that's christ's  story  it's his suffering and his  sacrifice you know  it's his sacrifice that we  live by and aspire to  and so i decided that i would  be grateful for every day i had  that i would be grateful for any answers  that came my way  but i would also be  grateful for the life i've had  and so i decided that that was the only  way i could go forward  and be  and be able to accept it
 

